{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 四期生 山田桃実(やまだももみ)です☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Sakurazaka46 ARENA TOUR 2026ｰWhat's lonesome？ｰ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "広島公演2日間ありがとうございました🍁"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私の出身が岡山で、せっかくならといとはさんがMCで一緒にただいま言おうよ！って誘ってくださって( т т )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いとはさんもあいりさんと3人で！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おかえり、ありがとうございました🙌🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobPSDRMB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobBEQ1yX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あげ太くんいました！！\n会いたかった~\n頭の上に立たそうとしましたが難しく\n結局壁にもたれかかりました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おしゃべり唐あげ あげ太くん\n広島弁と岡山弁だいぶ似ているので、大共感の嵐です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob04WDQi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobXOb0dI.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お店まであと40歩！\n気になって数えました\nジャスト40歩でした\n感動しました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "念願の初揚げもみじ饅頭は、チョコにしました~\n子供だねって言われた( т т )\nおいしかったです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobpFLQiA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1日目バタバタしてて撮り忘れてました💧‬\nでも毎公演撮れてるのでセーフです！\n今回はスライリーも一緒でした~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobeCdzvj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎回りこさんの髪型楽しみにしています♩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobZQ76KN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "スライリーの格好がツボです\nスライリー持ってるみうさん可愛かったです\n◜⩊◝"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次は千葉公演！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会場は四期生ライブぶりのLaLa arena TOKYOｰBAYです~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たのしみだ^_^‪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いします~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "8月14日(金)\nRNC西日本放送 「every.フライデー」\n純葉さんとインタビューしていただきました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "岡山にいる時に観てた番組で、、嬉しいです⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、\n8月25日(火)RNC西日本放送ラジオ\n「アイドルしか勝たん！」にも純葉さんと出演させていただきます⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ、観て聴いてください~\nよろしくお願いいたしますー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日8月11日(火・祝)より、\n全国のローソン店舗で「櫻坂46 日向坂46キャンペーン」がスタートしました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日姉から連絡があって、櫻坂くじを1回引いたら私のアクリルスタンドが当たったそうです~\nすごい👏🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "詳細はこちらから↓\nhttps://www.lawson.co.jp/lab/campaign/sakurahinata/"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いします~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてアリーナツアー第二弾のグッズを解禁いたしました~🐰"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「We got your back」のグッズもあります⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "チェック必須です✅"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ということで今日はここまで~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後までブログを読んでくださりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また来てね~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "山田桃実"}], "source": "official"}